<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5595" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμῡν-άθω</span></b> , pres. assumed by Gramm.,
		cf. Hdn.Gr.<i><span class="en">
			1.440
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			2.782
		</span></i>, as lengthd. form of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμύνω</span>:
		but forms so accented in codd. are best taken to belong to aor.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠμύναθον</span> and written <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμυναθεῖν</span> (so <i><span class="en">
			Hsch.
		</span></i>), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-θοῦ,</span> cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλκαθεῖν</span>:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>defend, assist,</i> c. dat. pers., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰ σοῖς φίλοις ἀμυναθεῖν χρῄζεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Andr.</u>
					1079
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>IA</u>
				910
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμυνάθετέ μοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Nu.</u>
					1323
				</span></i>
			: abs., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄξιαι δ᾽ ἀμυναθεῖν [αἱ ξυμφοραί]</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>OC</u>
					1015
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, <i>ward off from oneself, repel,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τόνδ᾽ ἀμυναθοῦ ψόγον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Eu.</u>
					438
				</span></i>
			; <i>take vengeance on,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μὴ . . ἀμυνάθοιτό σε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Andr.</u>
					721
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
